--------------------------------------------------------------------

This plugin runs the SenseNova-U1.5-8B-MoT model published by SenseTime
(https://huggingface.co/sensenova/SenseNova-U1.5-8B-MoT). The weights
are licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0 and are NOT
distributed with this plugin; obtaining them is subject to whatever
terms the publisher applies at the point of download.

The architecture was ported against the reference implementation at
https://github.com/OpenSenseNova/SenseNova-U1 (Apache-2.0). No code from
that repository is included here, and none is redistributed: it is
imported at development time only, to generate test fixtures, and is not
part of the built plugin.
